 "category": "image",
 "summary": "Lean, very fast Windows image viewer with a minimal full-screen GUI, real-time image correction (auto contrast, local density, sharpening) and keyboard control through an editable KeyMap. Handles modern formats and RAW. No thumbnails, no video, no file browser; the fork has had no release since 2023.",
 "where_it_wins": [
  "Real-time automatic colour, contrast and local density correction while viewing",
  "Extremely small and portable (no install)",
  "Fully remappable keys via KeyMap.txt",
  "Lossless JPEG crop/rotate",
  "Image series played as a movie at a set frame rate"
 ],
 "where_schnellbild_wins": [
  "Runs natively on the Mac",
  "Thumbnail grid with folder previews and list view",
  "Plays videos, also MKV/AVI/WebM",
  "Archives and comics as folders",
  "Recursive and regex search",
  "Dual pane, move/copy, undo",
  "Actively developed"
 ],
